; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Internationalization strings for VERSIONINFO resource.
; Usage:
; Copy all string values from [0000] (Language Neutral) below your language ID.
; Replace all strings behind the equal sign with the translated strings of 
; your language. (See [0407] German (Standard) as an example); 
; Language ID's without custom strings will be shown in English.
; Do NOT alter the strings at the left side of the equal sign!
; Don't forget to save the file!
; =============================================================================
; If you have translated the strings of your language it is a good idea to
; paste them into an e-mail and mailto freevcs@thensle.de - I will include
; these strings in the next release of this file.
; =============================================================================

; Language Neutral
[0000]
Author=Author
BuildTimestamp=BuildTimestamp
BuildType=BuildType
DebugBuild=DebugBuild
ReleaseBuild=ReleaseBuild
SpecialBuild=SpecialBuild
InternalBuild (NOT FOR RELEASE!)=InternalBuild (NOT FOR RELEASE!)
InternalVersion=InternalVersion
LegalTrademarks=LegalTrademarks

